    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Type-keyed channel seam impl" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/Channels/EmailChannelSender.cs">
        Implement `ICommunicationChannelSender` with `SupportedType =&gt; CommunicationType.Message`; own all provider (ACS) wire concerns; map provider errors to `SdapProblemException`; capture the provider message id into `ChannelSendResult.ProviderMessageId` best-effort. `MessagingChannelSender` mirrors this shape over ACS instead of Graph.
      </pattern>
